ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604212347229013_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604212347229013_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/match1713711date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛5连败！切尔西0-3布莱顿跌至第7先赛距前五7分 卡迪奥卢闪击</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220459448280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220459448280.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220459448280.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">切尔西在客场以0-3不敌布莱顿，遭遇联赛五连败，积分榜方面，切尔西积48分排名第七。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/match1730661date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">先赛距榜首6分！皇马2-1阿拉维斯 维尼修斯世界波姆巴佩破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260422/zhanbao_image_1730661_1776807203_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260422/zhanbao_image_1730661_1776807203_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260422/zhanbao_image_1730661_1776807203_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">皇马2-1阿拉维斯。积分榜方面，皇马73分先赛落后榜首6分，阿拉维斯33分第十七。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/match1921120date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">让二追三！国米总比分3-2科莫进决赛 苏契奇绝杀+2传1射恰20双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260422/zhanbao_image_1921120_1776804936_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260422/zhanbao_image_1921120_1776804936_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260422/zhanbao_image_1921120_1776804936_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">国米3-2逆转击败科莫，以两回合3-2比分淘汰科莫，进入意大利杯决赛。</span></p><p>【莱斯特城降级】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e795f587c35native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">唏嘘！莱斯特城遭2连降级提前降入英甲，整整十年前英超奇迹夺冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220440579548.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220440579548_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220440579548_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">英冠第44轮，莱斯特城主场2-2战平赫尔城，未能取胜，他们确定将提前降入英甲！</span></p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7ecf39ed9cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赛后开爆！罗塞尼尔：不想再维护球员 首发11人只有3、4人有决心</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220535119992.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220535119992.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220535119992.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">英超第34轮，切尔西0-3不敌布莱顿。赛后，切尔西主帅罗塞尼尔接受了天空体育的采访。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7e8259a964native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">签久了！切尔西联赛五连败一球不进，主帅罗塞尼尔合同还有6年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/69827d9899bea_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/69827d9899bea.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/69827d9899bea.jpg"> </div><p>主帅罗塞尼尔与切尔西签下的现有合同要到2032年才到期，现在怎么办？</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7ec74c12e1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">五连败有什么话说？查洛巴：大家把球袜都要跑掉了，已竭尽全力</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250921/68cfcf789505f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250921/68cfcf789505f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250921/68cfcf789505f.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">切尔西本轮不敌布莱顿。赛后，查洛巴接受采访。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7bf6a0d17bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">隆戈：有沙特球队3倍薪资报价拉比奥特，球员现年薪920万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/6969a1546a1fc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/6969a1546a1fc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/6969a1546a1fc.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者隆戈消息，有一家沙特球队给拉比奥特开出巨额年薪报价，是拉比奥特现薪资的三倍，拉比奥特现在的年薪是920万欧。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7c239b405enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">活久见！迪拜国民世界波绝平因对手没完成换人被吹，赛后疯狂抗议</a></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">亚冠精英联赛半决赛，町田泽维亚1-0战胜迪拜国民晋级决赛，他们将要对阵的是卫冕冠军吉达国民。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7b5a1142canative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：巴萨对留下拉师傅的热情已经降温，他没全抓住拉菲伤缺的机会</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/69df545877405.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/69df545877405.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/69df545877405.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">TA记者Laia Cervelló Herrero和Pol Ballús撰写巴萨转会专栏，从各个位置分析了巴萨对现有球员的规划和引援计划。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7b4e55cbe3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">卡塞米罗：曼联是英格兰最好的球队也是世界前3 曼彻斯特是红色的</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b7d7d6053b6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b7d7d6053b6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b7d7d6053b6.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">卡塞米罗在接受Away Days节目采访时表示，曼联是英格兰最佳球队，也是世界前三。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7af914b8d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">米体：超过70名人卷入买春风波，包括国米、米兰、尤文球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220111532942.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220111532942_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/202604220111532942_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">此前安莎社报道米兰警方捣毁一高端卖淫团伙，国米、米兰尤文球员涉案。米兰体育报进一步报道，透露了具体的人数和细节。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-22/69e7aa2a0bd81native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">才回购一年！德天空：特拉福德愿意今夏离开曼城，曼城希望留住他</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260215/6990b0a09bbd0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260215/6990b0a09bbd0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260215/6990b0a09bbd0.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">德天空独家报道，曼城于去年夏天回购的二门特拉福德愿意在今夏离队，以获得稳定的出场时间。曼城方面希望留住他。</span></p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;     color: white;     margin: 24px auto;     position: relative;     border-radius: 10px;     overflow: hidden; ">     <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 50px;     line-h